---
---
<section class="founder-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="founder-inner">

      <div class="founder-photo-wrap">
        <img
          src="/poza_vali.jpeg"
          alt="Valentin Avram — Fondator Hello Web"
          class="founder-photo"
          width="120"
          height="120"
        />
        <p class="founder-name">Valentin Avram</p>
        <p class="founder-title">Fondator Hello Web</p>
      </div>

      <div class="founder-quote-wrap">
        <p class="founder-quote">
          „Un vizitator care nu primește răspuns în 5 minute
          caută în altă parte. MyChatbot există pentru că am
          văzut prea mulți proprietari de business pierzând
          clienți din cauza unui mesaj fără răspuns."
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.founder-section {
  background: #f8fafc;
  border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
  padding: 3rem 0;
}
.founder-inner {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 3.5rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.founder-photo-wrap {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
}
.founder-photo {
  width: 120px;
  height: 120px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: top;
  display: block;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.12), 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}
.founder-name {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #0f172a;
  text-align: center;
}
.founder-title {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 11px;
  color: #94a3b8;
  text-align: center;
}
.founder-quote-wrap {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 280px;
  border-left: 3px solid #2563eb;
  padding-left: 2rem;
}
.founder-quote {
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: #1e293b;
  font-style: italic;
  margin: 0;
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .founder-inner {
    flex-direction: column;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .founder-quote-wrap {
    border-left: none;
    border-top: 3px solid #2563eb;
    padding-left: 0;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
  }
}
</style>
